{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17150","headline":"日暮碧云合 · 许康佐","name":"日暮碧云合","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日际愁阴生，天涯暮云碧。\n重重不辨盖，沈沈乍如积。\n林色黯疑暝，隟光俄已夕。\n出岫且从龙，萦空宁触石。\n余辉澹瑶草，浮影凝绮席。\n时景讵能留，几思轻尺璧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许康佐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17150.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17150","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}